{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","雷内亚"],["/names/en","Reinier"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名追求秩序的恶魔，能使用空间魔法将敌人送入另一维度的空间。"],["/description_i18n/en","A Hypogean who pursues order and is good at using spatial magic to send enemies into another dimension."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","世界需要均等。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","The world needs balance."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","完美之上还有更加完美。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","There are things more perfect than perfection."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","保持平衡，保持对称。"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Preserve balance, maintain harmony."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","失衡……让人作呕……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Disorder... is... disgusting..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","完美无需强调。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Perfection needs no emphasis."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","无可挑剔的对称，无可挑剔的完美。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","Impeccable symmetry, immaculate perfection."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","均衡完美。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Perfect. Balance."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","背面之姿同样美丽。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","I'm just as beautiful from the back."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","前左后右，前右后左，完成。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Front left, back right. Front right, back left."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","完美无缺的均衡，绝对均衡的完美。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Impeccably balanced, absolute perfection."],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","勉强平衡，可以更好。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Decent quality, could be improved."],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","神的作品，毫无美感。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/en","Divinely made, but without beauty."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","黄金比例的花纹，不错"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","This pattern has a golden ratio."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","真是完美无缺的艺术品"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","What a perfect piece of art."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","完美的圆形蛋糕，棒极了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","A perfectly round cake. Wonderful!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","雪花是完美的造物"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Snowflakes are the perfect creations of nature."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","真是完美无缺的艺术品"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/1/text_i18n/en","What a perfect piece of art."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","一片雪花，两片雪花……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Snowflakes... Ah, the symmetry!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","灯笼，如此对称……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","These lanterns are perfectly aligned."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","大部分焰火都很美丽"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","The fireworks are breathtakingly dazzling."],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","雷内亚连名字都是完美对称。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Even Reinier's name exudes an air of perfect symmetry."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","雷内亚厌恶大部分生命，因为他们只有一颗心脏，还总长在旁边。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Reinier detests most living creatures since they usually possess hearts that are not positioned symmetrically."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","雷内亚无法成为一个好的研究者，因为他厌恶一切不够“美丽”的图形、数字甚至公式。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Reinier can never hope to become an accomplished researcher since he reviles anything that fails to meet his standards of \"beauty\". This includes all graphs, formulas, and even numbers themselves."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","雷内亚厌恶许多东西，但最为讨厌的还是奇数、混乱和随机——这让他讨厌贝利尔甚至胜过厌恶大部分半神。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Reinier dislikes many things, but he especially detests odd numbers, chaos, and all things random. For this reason, his hatred for Berial is even greater than his hatred for most other Celestials."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","曾经有不愿公开姓名的恶魔透露过，雷内亚其实有严重的洁癖，这也是他为什么总是飘在半空中而不落地的缘故。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","An unnamed Hypogean once revealed that Reinier actually suffers from severe mysophobia, which is why he floats above the ground at all times."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","雷内亚爱极了完美的圆，但恨透了圆周率。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Reinier loves perfect circles but hates the number pi."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","金穗村曾经有村民找骑士团报案：一夜之间自己的美丽麦田里出现了很多同心圆。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","In a report to the Heroic Order, a Ryeham villager once claimed that several perfectly-concentric circles had appeared in his beautiful wheat fields overnight."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","曾经有过这样的一次报案：有位身材极其健美的骑士在晚上对镜欣赏自己的肌肉时，发现镜子里的自己变成了四手的怪物——而且怪物的肌肉更漂亮。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","In another report, a knight claims to have been admiring himself in a mirror when his reflection suddenly transformed into a giant, four-armed monster. Furthermore, the monster's muscles were even more beautiful than his own."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","雷内亚身上的装饰是他亲手绘制，每一笔都丝毫不差。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Each of Reinier's flawlessly exquisite adornments was crafted by his own hands."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","雷内亚最喜欢的天气是下雪天，因为每一片雪花都是无比精妙的对称——而在雪化成无法分割的水的时候，他的心情就会异常恶劣。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Snowy days are Reinier's favorite, since every single snowflake is perfectly and exquisitely symmetrical. However, he becomes abnormally irate when those snowflakes melt into shapeless water."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","可惜，何等可惜！只差一厘，你就是完美的形态！"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Alas, how regrettable. You're just a hair's breath from being perfect."],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415709.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415709.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","雷内亚 & 梅希拉"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Reinier & Mehira"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","真是个好日子，对吧？是个非常适合做坏事的天气吧？就在这种非常不合衬的光天化日之下！"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","Lovely day isn't it? Perfect for causing mischief, am I right? Right in the glaringly unfitting sunshine!"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415021.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415021.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","贝利尔 & 雷内亚"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Berial & Reinier"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","美，应当是漂浮无定的。"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Beauty is indefinite and unpredictable."],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415030.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415030.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","普鲁斯托 & 雷内亚"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Phraesto & Reinier"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","黄金比例的花纹，不错"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","This pattern has a golden ratio."],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415150.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415150.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","雷内亚"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Reinier"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","完美的圆形蛋糕，棒极了"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","A perfectly round cake. Wonderful!"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415151.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415151.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","雷内亚"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Reinier"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","雪花是完美的造物"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","Snowflakes are the perfect creations of nature."],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415469.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415469.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","雷内亚"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Reinier"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","一片雪花，两片雪花……"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Snowflakes... Ah, the symmetry!"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415470.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415470.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","雷内亚"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Reinier"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","灯笼，如此对称……"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","These lanterns are perfectly aligned."],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415649.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415649.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","雷内亚"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Reinier"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","大部分焰火都很美丽"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","The fireworks are breathtakingly dazzling."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415650.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415650.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","雷内亚"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Reinier"]]}